          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-label text-primary font-bold text-sm mb-2">PANEL WEIGHT</p>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm">~4 kg/m² (30mm) | ~6 kg/m² (50mm)</p>
          </div>
          <div>
