        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">Honeycomb Mezzanine Panels — Spec'd in Balakong</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed mb-6">Adding a mezzanine to your warehouse, distribution centre, or storage facility in Selangor or Klang Valley? Send us your floor plan dimensions and load requirement. We will spec the right panel grade, cut to your layout, and deliver to site.</p>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface mb-6"><strong>Contact Quinocycle today:</strong></p>
