      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">Conclusion: Lighter Decking, Lower Total Cost</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed mb-4">Mezzanine projects look like steel projects, but the deck spec drives 30-40% of the total cost. Drop the deck weight, drop the steel section, drop the project budget. Honeycomb panels deliver this directly — and on light-storage mezzanines they come pre-engineered for the exact load you need. For Klang Valley warehouses planning expansion, talk to us before the steel is ordered.</p>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed">WhatsApp the floor plan and target load — we will turn around a panel spec and quote within one business day.</p>
      </section>
